cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "m2n2: mixed modeling with neural networks"
abstract: >
  m2n2 fits a linear mixed model based on a neural network. The network
  is trained jointly with the fixed effects and the variance components on the REML loss.
